{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-sanos-apis",
    "name": "Sanos y Salvos — User + Pet + Report",
    "description": "ORDEN: 1) Ejecuta **Auth — POST login** (guarda solo `token` y `userId` vía Tests). 2) Luego **GET /users/me** con ese token. 3) Pet: primero **POST crear mascota** (guarda `petId`). 4) Report: **POST report** necesita `petId`.\n\n**Feign (prueba indirecta):** **POST pet** → Feign a User; **POST report** → Feign a Pet + User; **DELETE pet** (si hay reportes) → Feign a Report; **GET internal/.../activity** → Feign a Pet + Report.\n\n**Si ves 400 y path `/api/v1/pets`:** no ejecutaste Login antes o `userId` está vacío → falta query `ownerUserId` o cabecera `X-User-Id`.\n\n**Si `/users/me` da 401/403:** `token` vacío o caducado → vuelve a hacer Login.\n\n**Servicios levantados:** user :8081, report :8082, pet :8083.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrlUser", "value": "http://localhost:8081" },
    { "key": "baseUrlPet", "value": "http://localhost:8083" },
    { "key": "baseUrlReport", "value": "http://localhost:8082" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "petId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "reportId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "sightingId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "reportMediaId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "targetUserId", "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "msvc-user (8081)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Auth — POST /api/v1/auth/register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Juan\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Perez\",\n  \"email\": \"juan.perez@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Abcdef12\",\n  \"confirmPassword\": \"Abcdef12\",\n  \"phone\": \"+56912345678\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrlUser}}/api/v1/auth/register",
            "description": "Contraseña: mayúscula, minúscula y número (mín. 8)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Auth — POST /api/v1/auth/login (ejecutar PRIMERO)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.token); }",
                  "  if (j.userId) { pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', j.userId); }",
                  "  pm.test('Login OK: token y userId guardados en la colección', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(j.token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(j.userId).to.exist;",
                  "  });",
                  "} else {",
                  "  pm.test('Login falló: ' + pm.response.code, function () { pm.expect.fail(); });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrlUser}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "description": "Abre la pestaña **Test** del resultado: si va bien, `token` y `userId` se guardan solos en Variables de la colección."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Users — GET /api/v1/users/me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrlUser}}/api/v1/users/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Users — PATCH /api/v1/users/me",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Admin\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Salvos\",\n  \"phone\": \"+56912345678\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrlUser}}/api/v1/users/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Users — PATCH /api/v1/users/{id}/role (ADMIN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"OWNER\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrlUser}}/api/v1/users/{{targetUserId}}/role",
            "description": "Solo rol ADMIN. Ajusta targetUserId al UUID del usuario objetivo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Internal — GET /api/v1/internal/users/{userId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrlUser}}/api/v1/internal/users/{{userId}}",
            "description": "Usuario por id (API interna). Sin JWT en dev (permitAll para Feign)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Internal — GET /api/v1/internal/users/{userId}/activity (Feign → pet + report)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrlUser}}/api/v1/internal/users/{{userId}}/activity",
            "description": "Prueba Feign desde User: cuenta mascotas (Pet Service) y reportes (Report Service). Requiere user, pet y report levantados. Tras Login, `userId` ya está en la colección."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "msvc-pet (8083)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/pets (lista por dueño)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-User-Id", "value": "{{userId}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrlPet}}/api/v1/pets?ownerUserId={{userId}}",
            "description": "Requiere Login antes: `ownerUserId` y `X-User-Id` deben ser el mismo UUID. Si `userId` está vacío → 400 Bad Request."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/pets/{petId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrlPet}}/api/v1/pets/{{petId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/v1/pets (crear)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('petId', j.id); }",
                  "  pm.test('petId guardado', function () { pm.expect(j.id).to.exist; });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-User-Id", "value": "{{userId}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"ownerUserId\": \"{{userId}}\",\n  \"name\": \"Firulais\",\n  \"species\": \"Perro\",\n  \"breed\": \"Mestizo\",\n  \"color\": \"Negro\",\n  \"size\": \"MEDIUM\",\n  \"status\": \"LOST\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrlPet}}/api/v1/pets",
            "description": "Requiere Login. Tests guardan `petId`. Quitar `microchipNumber` si da error de validación."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /api/v1/pets/{petId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-User-Id", "value": "{{userId}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Firulais II\",\n  \"status\": \"FOUND\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrlPet}}/api/v1/pets/{{petId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /api/v1/pets/{petId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-User-Id", "value": "{{userId}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrlPet}}/api/v1/pets/{{petId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "msvc-report (8082)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Reportes — GET /api/v1/reports (paginado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/reports?page=0&size=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrlReport}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "reports"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "0" },
                { "key": "size", "value": "20" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reportes — POST /api/v1/reports",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('reportId', j.id); }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-User-Id", "value": "{{userId}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tipo\": \"LOST\",\n  \"titulo\": \"Se perdió mi mascota\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Zona centro, collar rojo\",\n  \"latitud\": -33.45,\n  \"longitud\": -70.65,\n  \"ubicacionTexto\": \"Santiago\",\n  \"petId\": \"{{petId}}\",\n  \"reporterUserId\": \"{{userId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/reports",
            "description": "Antes crea una mascota (POST pet). `petId` no puede estar vacío. Tests guardan `reportId` si 201."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reportes — GET /api/v1/reports/{reportId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reportes — PATCH /api/v1/reports/{reportId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"titulo\": \"Actualizado\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Nueva info\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reportes — POST /api/v1/reports/{reportId}/resolve",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"motivo\": \"ENCONTRADO\",\n  \"nota\": \"Volvió a casa\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}/resolve"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reportes — PATCH /api/v1/reports/{reportId}/close",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}/close"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reportes — DELETE /api/v1/reports/{reportId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Por mascota — GET /api/v1/pets/{petId}/reports (page)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/pets/{{petId}}/reports?page=0&size=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrlReport}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "pets", "{{petId}}", "reports"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "0" },
                { "key": "size", "value": "20" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Por mascota — GET /api/v1/pets/{petId}/reports/all",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/pets/{{petId}}/reports/all",
            "description": "Misma ruta que usa Feign en msvc-pet (ReportServiceClient)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Por usuario — GET /api/v1/users/me/reports",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-User-Id", "value": "{{userId}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/users/me/reports"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Por usuario — GET /api/v1/users/{userId}/reports",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/reports"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Por usuario — GET /api/v1/users/{userId}/reports/{reportId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/reports/{{reportId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Avistamientos — GET /api/v1/reports/{reportId}/sightings",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}/sightings"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Avistamientos — POST /api/v1/reports/{reportId}/sightings",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"spottedAt\": \"2026-04-21T12:00:00Z\",\n  \"notes\": \"Visto cerca del parque\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}/sightings",
            "description": "No envíes id ni report en el JSON; el backend asigna el reporte."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Avistamientos — GET /api/v1/reports/{reportId}/sightings/{sightingId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}/sightings/{{sightingId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Avistamientos — DELETE /api/v1/reports/{reportId}/sightings/{sightingId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}/sightings/{{sightingId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Media reporte — GET /api/v1/reports/{reportId}/media",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}/media"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Media reporte — POST /api/v1/reports/{reportId}/media",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"url\": \"https://ejemplo.com/foto.jpg\",\n  \"sortOrder\": 0\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}/media"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Media reporte — GET /api/v1/reports/{reportId}/media/{mediaId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}/media/{{reportMediaId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Media reporte — DELETE /api/v1/reports/{reportId}/media/{mediaId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrlReport}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}/media/{{reportMediaId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
